Algorithm ComputeResidualClasses(F, K):
    profiles = {}
    classes = {}
    for p in F:
        row_p = tuple(K(p, q) for q in F)
        if row_p in profiles:
            classes[profiles[row_p]].add(p)
        else:
            profiles[row_p] = p
            classes[p] = {p}
    return classes

Complexity: O(|F|^2) time, O(|F|^2) space
